<title>KENYA: CRICKET-KENYA V PAKISTAN SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-KENYA V PAKISTAN SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the one-day</p>
<p>four-nations Kenyan Centenary match between Kenya and Pakistan</p>
<p>on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Kenya</p>
<p>D.Chudasama c Saeed Azad b Salim Malik  51</p>
<p> K.Otieno c Ramiz Raja b Waqar Younis    25</p>
<p> S.Gupta c Moin Khan b Waqar Younis	 0</p>
